  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 2nd level, a battle butler gains a formless servant to help him in their chores and duties. This functions as per an unseen servant spell with an unlimited duration and it takes a full round to conjure the servant. The battle butler may only have 1 unseen servant at a time from this class feature. All unseen servants under his command are destroyed after 1 hour if the battle butler is rendered unconscious.</p>\n<p>At 13th level, a battle butler can summon a fleet of unseen servants. When he conjures his unseen servant, he instead conjures a number equal to 1/2 his battle butler level (minimum 1). He may only have a number of unseen servants at a time equal to 1/2 his battle butler level from this class feature.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/battle-butler#toc36\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
